{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他心里还憋着气，想起从前曾被人当作自己人，短暂高兴了一下，但很快又因过去回不去而心酸，怀疑离开后是否真的会更好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、短暂欣喜、酸涩、犹疑\",\n      \"missed\": \"和弦像重锤、切分节奏让脚步乱的音乐描述；暂时离开沉重问题、获得片刻轻松却没有答案；以及旋律低声絮语、调性像流沙等意象，都需要逐句读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起曾经被当作自己人的时光而短暂开心，但还没从这份高兴中缓过来，就意识到过去已经回不去，开始怀疑离开是否真能换来更好的生活。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、短暂轻松、心酸、失落、迷茫\",\n      \"missed\": \"小字中关于出去走走、聊点别的只是暂时逃开沉重问题，以及昂扬退潮后仍然怀疑自己究竟是真相信还是努力相信的内容。一眼也不容易看出底部密集点线动画与人物处境的具体联系。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起过去被当作自己人的日子，短暂高兴后又因那些日子无法重来而心酸，不确定离开之后是不是真的会过得更好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、怀念、短暂欣喜、柔和、酸涩、失落\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的焦躁急切转向柔和、故乡夏日麦浪与微风、越亲切越感到遥远这一层，需要读小字才能抓到。旋律低声絮语、调性像流沙的描述也不容易一眼吸收。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"人物的事情和情绪转折在两条大标题中基本能连起来，但音乐意象与人物处境之间的联系主要放在字号较小、内容较长的说明里。第一眼容易抓到憋闷、短暂高兴、随后心酸，却不容易同时抓到重锤、脚步乱、麦浪微风、亲切却遥远这些画面如何共同对应他的心境。底部抽象点线动画也没有提供足够明确的情境线索。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9af4b643-0ebf-4dc0-8583-7207f8e0f78e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001623313793Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:17:46.136650+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fa91749fa5f8a7d21aa7c8939424a093cf6ef26b80f66c776e7e2611df4a77dd", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001623313793Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1c80772d9e92483406484e596f8a48f95fead4801b966b247c546efdb43b13fc"}}}
